## BLUETOOTH 
| Filter                                | Why Important                                        |
| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `bthci_evt`                           | To observe Bluetooth discovery and connection events |
| `bthci_acl`                           | To observe Bluetooth data communication              |
| `btl2cap`                             | To analyze pairing and logical channel communication |
| `btatt`                               | To analyze BLE attribute communication               |
| `btsdp`                               | To analyze service discovery                         |
| `btle`                                | To analyze BLE traffic                               |
| `bthid`                               | To analyze Bluetooth keyboard/mouse activity         |
| `bthci_evt.code == 0x16`              | To identify PIN request events                       |
| `bluetooth.addr == XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX` | To filter traffic for a specific Bluetooth device    |

