WHAT TO LOOK FOR 

| Question Asked               | Filter                   | Packet to Choose    |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------- |
| Find discovery process       | `bthci_evt`              | Inquiry packets     |
| Find connection process      | `bthci_evt`              | Connection Complete |
| Find PIN request             | `bthci_evt.code == 0x16` | PIN Code Request    |
| Find Bluetooth communication | `bthci_acl`              | ACL packets         |
| Find pairing/L2CAP           | `btl2cap`                | L2CAP packets       |
| Find BLE data                | `btatt`                  | ATT packets         |
| Find services                | `btsdp`                  | SDP packets         |
| Find device MAC              | `bthci_acl`              | HCI ACL Packet      |



