WHAT TO LOOK FOR

| Question Asked      | Filter to Use                | Packet to Select        |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Find SSID           | `wlan.fc.type_subtype == 8`  | Beacon frame            |
| Find WPA handshake      | `eapol`                      | EAPOL packets           |
| Find MAC address    | `wlan`                       | Any WLAN packet         |
| Find authentication | `wlan.fc.type_subtype == 11` | Authentication packet   |
| Find deauth attack  | `wlan.fc.type_subtype == 12` | Deauthentication packet |
| Find probe request  | `wlan.fc.type_subtype == 4`  | Probe Request           |



